abstract: "A fault-injection (chaos engineering) checker for Apache Iceberg table maintenance (rewrite_data_files, expire_snapshots, remove_orphan_files), with the full results of a 369-cell crash-interleaving study across three Iceberg builds (1.7.1, 1.12.0, main). No data-integrity or retained-snapshot violation was found in any cell; the only reported-progress flags map to the existing open issue apache/iceberg#17202, which a gated race re-run shows firing on current builds (8/8 on 1.12.0, 7/8 on main)."
